rks\n\t\t\n\t\t\tYLiu\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tQZhang\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tYGao\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tDZhao\n\t\t\n\t\t10.1109/TCDS.2024.3384269\n\t\n\t\n\t\tIEEE Transactions on Cognitive and Developmental Systems\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t2024","doi":"10.1109/TCDS.2024.3384269","arxiv_id":null,"title":"Deep Reinforcement Learning-Based Driving Policy at Intersections Utilizing Lane Graph Networks","anchors":[{"ref_id":"b8","section_path_id":"1","quote":"[9]","offset":331}]},{"raw_text":"Survey of Deep Reinforcement Learning for Motion Planning of Autonomous Vehicles\n\t\t\n\t\t\tSzilárdAradi\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tIEEE Transactions on Intelligent Transportation Systems\n\t\t\n\t\t\t23\n\t\t\t2\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t2022","doi":null,"arxiv_id":null,"title":"Survey of Deep Reinforcement Learning for Motion Planning of Autonomous Vehicles","anchors":[]},{"raw_text":"Dynamic-Horizon Model-Based Value Estimation With Latent Imagination\n\t\t\n\t\t\tJWang\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tQZhang\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tDZhao\n\t\t\n\t\t10.1109/TNNLS.2022.3215788\n\t\n\t\n\t\tIEEE Transactions on Neural Networks and Learning Systems\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t2022","doi":"10.1109/TNNLS.2022.3215788","arxiv_id":null,"title":"Dynamic-Horizon Model-Based Value Estimation With Latent Imagination","anchors":[]},{"raw_text":"Prototypical Context-Aware Dynamics for Generalization in Visual Control With Model-Based Reinforcement Learning\n\t\t\n\t\t\tJWang\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tQZhang\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tYMu\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tDLi\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tDZhao\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tYZhuang\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tPLuo\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tBWang\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tJHao\n\t\t\n\t\t10.1109/TII.2024.3396525\n\t\n\t\n\t\tIEEE Transactions on Industrial Informatics\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t2024","doi":"10.1109/TII.2024.3396525","arxiv_id":null,"title":"Prototypical Context-Aware Dynamics for Generalization in Visual Control With Model-Based Reinforcement Learning","anchors":[{"ref_id":"b11","section_path_id":"1","quote":"[12]","offset":336}]},{"raw_text":"Sta